rogii-clang-tools
=================

This package redistributes components of the LLVM Project, licensed under the
Apache License v2.0 with LLVM Exceptions (see LICENSE). Most are unmodified; any
local patch is noted below and recorded in this repository's git history.

Bundled artifacts (all from LLVM release 22.1.7):

  bin/clang-apply-replacements.exe
      Native tool from the official LLVM.org Windows release
      "clang+llvm-22.1.7-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc".

  src/rogii_clang_tools/run_clang_tidy.py
      clang-tools-extra/clang-tidy/tool/run-clang-tidy.py at tag llvmorg-22.1.7.

  src/rogii_clang_tools/clang_tidy_diff.py
      clang-tools-extra/clang-tidy/tool/clang-tidy-diff.py at tag llvmorg-22.1.7,
      with a local patch: emit the -line-filter file name in both path-separator
      styles so changed-line diagnostics are not silently suppressed on Windows
      (see https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/issues/112038 and git history).

The LLVM sources' license headers are preserved. The package version is
<bundled LLVM release>.<packaging revision> (e.g. 22.1.7.1); the packaging
revision increments for changes like the patch above without a new LLVM release.
